rica First stopped just as badly as the Democrat Communists caused this. Now, the cheerleaders will reward them by sending them more money to \"stop the Democrats\".", "author": "BurtMcGirt", "created": 1793794911329, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "RetardIsMyName", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "The Doomers were right again ", "last_comment_created": 1793815689506, "content": "<p>Or as I call us... &quot;the people who recognize patterns&quot;.</p>\n<p>The border was temporarily secured, and that is great. Other than that, basically nothing was accomplished that helps Americans in our day to day lives. We still have 50+ million illegals here, we still have a legal immigration program that may even be worse. Not a single person was punished for a coup, multiple stolen elections, the Plandemic, the weaponization of govt, the engineered invasion, etc. We are directly in a war for a foreign country and funding another war where neither benefits us. Nothing has been more demoralizing to America First Republicans and Independents.</p>\n<p>Yes, it will definitely be worse under Democrat Communist control, and yes I still voted. The &quot;Doomers&quot; didn't cause this. The cheerleaders caused this, because you will still send your money to neocons who ran out the clock starting in the first quarter. The Neocons who wanted America First stopped just as badly as the Democrat Communists caused this. Now, the cheerleaders will reward them by sending them more money to &quot;stop the Democrats&quot;.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 56, "score_up": 218, "is